            "value": "No session in this range recorded any active minutes. A Claude Code version that writes no usage fields leaves this empty, which is not the same as no work."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这个范围内没有会话记录到活跃分钟数。有些 Claude Code 版本不写用量字段，会让这里空着，这和没有工作并不是一回事。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "overview.noHours.title": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
